skills.description:
For 5s, beams of light rain down, randomly striking enemies in a massive circular area, dealing physical damage equal to 140-220% of Attack up to 5 times per second. Each target can only be hit once every 0.5s. If cast while under {grace}, removes the status and gains additional effects based on the number of {radiant_ember} stacks: 
[1]: Upon casting, grants a Shield equal to 150% of Attack for 6s, and allies in the area gain {attack_boost};
[2]: Increases damage by 40%, and grants 4 stacks of {deathrattle} when the skill ends;
[3]: Upon casting, all allies except self gain {attack_boost}, while self gains {significant_attack_boost}.

Copies and casts an enhanced version of the last skill used:
Enhanced [Curse Blast]: Damage coefficient increased to 1540-2660% of own Attack. If the target is marked, this skill gains 1,500 Crit;
Enhanced [Soul Chain]: Damage coefficient increased to 950-1550% of own Attack, and the Seal effect is extended to 10 seconds;
Enhanced [Otherworldly Twin]: Area expanded, damage coefficient increased to 1100-1740% of own Attack, and creates an additional Mirror Image at the starting position;
Each time an ally is defeated, gains 1 stack of {deathrattle}. For each stack of {deathrattle}, 2nd skill's Haste is increased.
